      "content": "To initiate the computer repair process, begin by examining the hardware."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "proceed with repairing any issues that were identified."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "After the necessary repairs have been made, conclude the hardware inspection."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "Following the completion of the repair process, it is important to test the functionality of the system."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "If the test results indicate that everything is functioning properly, then the hardware inspection process can be concluded."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "However, if the test results indicate that there are still issues, then further hardware repairs are required."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
